License File: LICENSE

Description:
  Single header YAML 1.0 C++11 serializer/deserializer.

Local Modifications:
 - Yaml.cpp:1460 - widened the printable-character check from `> 125` to
   `> 126` so a bare `~` in a plain scalar (e.g. `target: ~/.java`) parses.
 - Yaml.cpp:1663 - added an early `return true` when a map key has no inline
   value and the next line starts a block sequence at the same offset, so
   same-indent `only:` / `rules:` lists parse.
